WEBVTT

34:02.650 --> 34:05.403
ROBERT: I'll bet you smell
of blackberry jam!

34:05.528 --> 34:08.364
Let me smell it. Come here.

34:09.907 --> 34:12.869
Can I leave this with you?
The message from Lord Stark.

34:12.994 --> 34:15.204
I don't serve Lord Stark.

34:18.416 --> 34:20.418
(LAUGHTER CONTINUES)
